    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned space station. Its only inhabitant, a strange AI whose purpose was to help the station inhabitants and you, a girl who must escape it, uncovering the mystery of what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a crash in space, you\u2019ve found yourself on the rehabilitation bay of an unknown space station. Aided by \u201cPROMPTY\u201d -the station\u2019s AI- to recover your previous mobility and abilities, soon you will find out that you are both alone amidst strange and dangerous energy beings. Will you be able to make your escape from the station and figure out the fate of their previous inhabitants?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to move fast and be precise, mastering the mechanics of this challenging experience of platforming in first person- </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and travel across a retro-futuristic space station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets behind the inhabitants\u2019 disappearance-</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with PROMPTY, the helpful and quirky station\u2019s AI-</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the leaderboards on speedrun competitions.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned space station. Its only inhabitant, a strange AI whose purpose was to help the station inhabitants and you, a girl who must escape it, uncovering the mystery of what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a crash in space, you\u2019ve found yourself on the rehabilitation bay of an unknown space station. Aided by \u201cPROMPTY\u201d -the station\u2019s AI- to recover your previous mobility and abilities, soon you will find out that you are both alone amidst strange and dangerous energy beings. Will you be able to make your escape from the station and figure out the fate of their previous inhabitants?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to move fast and be precise, mastering the mechanics of this challenging experience of platforming in first person- </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and travel across a retro-futuristic space station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets behind the inhabitants\u2019 disappearance-</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with PROMPTY, the helpful and quirky station\u2019s AI-</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the leaderboards on speedrun competitions.</p></li></ul>",
